# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keeps the necro hotbar open and reads its Unholy Symbol count into a list.
# The necro abilities compare the list. A closed hotbar is opened again every 30 seconds.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ wait
#
#   wait__message
#      How long an ability gets to answer before its reply is read. One round trip plus
#      the server's turn. A reply that arrives late is not lost: the next pass fires again
#      and reads the cooldown refusal instead.
#
#   wait__ability_target
#      How long the cursor of Poison Strike or Vampiric Embrace may take.
#
#   interval__necro_action
#      The retry window the Unholy Symbol abilities share. The game refuses with a
#      cooldown line of its own, so this only stops asking again every pass while that
#      runs.
#
#   interval__hotbar_check
#      How often a closed hotbar is looked for, and so how long a lost one waits. It only
#      closes on a death, a relog or a stray click, and while it is closed every ability
#      parks.
#
#   wait__hotbar_gump
#      How long the hotbar gump may take to open.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! wait__message 400
@setvar! wait__ability_target 1000
@setvar! interval__necro_action 30500
@setvar! interval__hotbar_check 30000
@setvar! wait__hotbar_gump 1000


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ timer
#
#   timer__hotbar_check
#      Ready on the first pass, so a closed hotbar is opened at once.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
timer__hotbar_check interval__hotbar_check


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ state
#
#   var__symbols_listed
#      The reading the list was last filled from. 99 matches no reading, so the first pass
#      fills the list whatever a previous run left in it.
#
#   var__symbols_spent
#      Scratch: 1 once a necro ability spent symbols on this pass. Poison Strike sits that
#      pass out, since the list is only rebuilt on the next one.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! var__symbols_listed 99
@setvar! var__symbols_spent 0


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ setup
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
if not listexists 'list__necro_symbols'
    createlist 'list__necro_symbols'
endif


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @ loop
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    # UNHOLY SYMBOLS
    #
    # The count is read off the necro hotbar gump, which prints them as "<have>/<max>".
    # ingump matches a substring, so the chain runs from the top down: "10/" is checked
    # before the single digits, and none of "1/" to "9/" occurs inside "10/10", so each
    # line only ever sees the count it names. Ten is the ceiling: the bank is Effective
    # Necromancy / 10 and this character sits at 100. Should the hotbar ever show more
    # than ten, add the higher readings above the 10/ line, or a two digit reading falls
    # into "1/". An elseif chain is evaluated in a single tick, whatever its length.
    #
    # A closed gump reads as zero, which parks every ability. Only then, in the last arm,
    # is the hotbar looked for, every interval__hotbar_check, so a pass that reads a count
    # pays nothing for it. The clock restarts once it has looked, so a hotbar missing
    # behind an open cursor is tried again on the next pass.
    #
    # The gates compare against the list, list 'x' >= n being the one size comparison a
    # script variable takes part in. Each reading refills the list only when it differs
    # from the last fill: at ten symbols the old refill on every pass was some twenty
    # statements, this is two, the chain and the inner if. The fill is a literal for count
    # per reading because a for count cannot be a variable.
    # ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    if ingump "10/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 10
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 10
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 10
        endif
    elseif ingump "9/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 9
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 9
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 9
        endif
    elseif ingump "8/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 8
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 8
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 8
        endif
    elseif ingump "7/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 7
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 7
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 7
        endif
    elseif ingump "6/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 6
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 6
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 6
        endif
    elseif ingump "5/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 5
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 5
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 5
        endif
    elseif ingump "4/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 4
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 4
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 4
        endif
    elseif ingump "3/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 3
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 3
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 3
        endif
    elseif ingump "2/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 2
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 2
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 2
        endif
    elseif ingump "1/" 622436516
        if var__symbols_listed != 1
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'

            for 1
                pushlist 'list__necro_symbols' '1' 'back'
            endfor

            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 1
        endif
    else
        if var__symbols_listed != 0
            clearlist 'list__necro_symbols'
            @setvar! var__symbols_listed 0
        endif

        if timer "timer__hotbar_check" >= interval__hotbar_check
            if skill "Necromancy" > 0 and not gumpexists 622436516
                if not targetexists and not casting
                    settimer "timer__hotbar_check" 0

                    if findtype 'necromancer book' backpack
                        yell '[necromancyhotbar'
                        waitforgump 622436516 wait__hotbar_gump
                    elseif timer "timer__message" >= interval__message
                        overhead "[ necro book, out ]" 254
                        settimer "timer__message" 0
                    endif
                endif
            else
                settimer "timer__hotbar_check" 0
            endif
        endif
    endif
